# EXISTING POOL mol1_tsim4 -- the configuration it was generated with, as a record and for re-ranking.
# gen/mol1_tsim4 already holds poses, so 'template' and 'cofold' REFUSE (the unmixed-pool guard), and
# SCORED points at the existing merged table, so 'rerank' refuses too. Use: status | mlff | select.
# To re-run this configuration, copy it to config/arms/<new>.env with a NEW POOL and drop SET/SCORED.
POOL=mol1_tsim4
CKPT_LABEL=mol1
TEMPLATE_MODE=similarity                  # per-ligand top-4 distinct co-crystal ligands by ECFP4
SET=mol1tsim4
SCORED=$GBSA_DIR/scored_mol1_tsim4.csv
